OL,3,ASuper El Nino sets another record as it
OL,4,Astrengthens to 'unprecedented levels'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEl Nino has continued to strengthen to
OL,7,Fwhat some scientists are calling
OL,8,F"unprecedented levels", weeks before
OL,9,Fits expected peak in December.
OL,11,FSeveral key measures are now in record
OL,12,Fterritory.
OL,14,FIn its latest update, Australia's
OL,15,FBureau of Meteorology (BOM) said
OL,16,Faverage weekly sea-surface temperatures
OL,17,Fin the central Pacific have reached
OL,18,Ftheir highest level on record.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
