OL,3,ASuper El Nino sets another record as it
OL,4,Astrengthens to 'unprecedented levels'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after scientists declared a
OL,7,Fnew record for daily sea surface
OL,8,Ftemperatures in the central-eastern
OL,9,FPacific in September, exceeding the
OL,10,Fprevious record set during the very
OL,11,Fstrong El Nino of 2015.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
